    "title": "Ledyard beats Montville 44-16 in ECC matchup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Marc Robbins ,\n1 days ago (WFSB) - Ledyard took down Montville in an ECC football matchup. Montville trailed 8-0 before quarterback Colt Force scored on a run up the middle. He appeared to have been stonewalled, but managed to break free and went the distance for the score. His determination put Montville on the board. Read full article",
